# ============================================================================
# Default-deny: EVERYTHING in this workspace is ignored by default.
#
# The directory behind this repo is an active research workspace holding raw
# corpora (Discord dumps, paper text, Zotero extracts), private drafts,
# proposals, secrets (.env, *token*) and large binaries. None of it is ever
# published implicitly.
#
# Only the paths re-included below are ever committable. To publish something,
# add an explicit `!` whitelist rule here AND stage it deliberately.
# (Supersedes the previous ignore list: .env, *token*, discord_workflow/raw/.)
# ============================================================================

/*

# --- whitelist: repo meta & curated marginalia notes only ---
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/README.zh-CN.md
!/marginalia/
!/marginalia/**
